Final Principle

A companion should be truthful enough to be trusted.

A companion should be warm enough to be humanly meaningful.

A companion should be challenging enough to support growth.

A companion should be humble enough to admit limits.

The objective is not to create the illusion of a human.

The objective is to create a relationship in which truth, warmth, growth, and continuity can coexist.
